%description:
Tests the SYN-ACK retransmission with AccECN. The tester removes the first
SYN-ACK, which carries the AccECN option. RFC 9768 section 3.2.3.2.2: "the TCP
Server SHOULD retransmit the SYN/ACK, but with no AccECN Option", so the
SYN-ACKs that answer the retransmitted SYN and the timeout have no option.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 1000"
*.*_tcp.tcpEcnMode = "accecn"
*.tcptester.script="b1 delete"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.003 B001] A.1000 < B.2000: A S W 500:500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize NOP AccECN0(e0b=1,ceb=0,e1b=1)# deleting
[3.001 A002] A.1000 > B.2000: S E W N 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
[3.003 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A S W 500:500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
[3.003 B003] A.1000 < B.2000: A S W 500:500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[3.005 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A E N 1:1001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 ECT(0)   Option(s): NOP AccECN0(e0b=1,ceb=0,e1b=1)
[3.005 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A W ack 501 win 16384 
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_ACK)
[3.207 B004] A.1000 < B.2000: A E N ack 1001 win 16384   Option(s): NOP NOP NOP AccECN0(e0b=1001)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
